# Normalise line endings.
#
# Without this, `npm run format` rewrites every file it touches: prettier writes
# LF, the working tree is CRLF (core.autocrlf=true), and git reports the lot as
# modified. One format run produced 199 changed files where only 38 had real
# changes.
#
# `eol=lf` checks files out as LF so prettier's output matches what is on disk.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
